{"type": "entity", "id": "input-validation#1.69", "hash": "d512403a", "kind": "values", "subject": "input", "origin": "## Input Validation", "lines": [249, 251], "text": "- **Boundary:** Layout values\n  - **What to validate:** Text extent (`BaseDocument::text_extent`)\n  - **How (stack-specific):** Since 2026-10-19-visual-lint a read-only reader on every document, remote pages included: an id that does not resolve, a node that is no inline root or one with no inline layout data reads `None` through `get_node`, never an index; it mutates nothing and has no log site, print, env read or panic path; it returns geometry only, and its one non-test caller is `Session::lint`, in process and through the `lint` verb's arm (packages/blitz-dom/src/text_extent.rs:18-54)", "class": "stale"}
